lla slices.\n- Drizzle extra virgin olive oil over the salad.\n- Season with salt and black pepper to taste.\n- Drizzle balsamic glaze over the salad.\n- Serve the Caprese salad as an appetizer or a light side dish.\nfavorite: false",
